 "summary": "Prohibits the use of drilling fluids, brine and flowback water from wells, pools or fields on any highway for any purpose including but not limited to de-icing or dust suppression.",
 "title": "Prohibits the use of drilling fluids, brine and flowback water from wells, pools or fields on any highway",
 "vetoMessages": {
  "items": [
   {
    "billId": {
